statement/prospectus, are redeemed for an aggregate payment of approximately $80.5&nbsp;million from the Trust Account as of December 31, 2022, which is a redemptions scenario that could occur. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:8pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
