<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">The Sponsor Parties&#146;s equity interests following the Closing are expected to comprise, as of the date of
this proxy statement/prospectus, 464,150 Private Shares, 2,482,500 Founder Shares held by the Maxpro Sponsor and 105,000 Founder Shares held by Maxpro directors and officers. In addition, Maxpro Investment Co., Ltd., an affiliate of the Sponsor, is
a PIPE Investor and is purchasing 2,100,000 Apollomics Series A Preferred Shares in the PIPE Financing, which will convert into 2,625,000 Apollomics Ordinary Shares, which shares are not reflected in the totals held by the Sponsor Parties in this
table. See &#147;Shares underlying Apollomics Series A Preferred Shares and Penny Warrants held by PIPE Investors&#148; and footnote 12 in this table. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
