STYLE="white-space:nowrap">APL-106</FONT> data suggests long-term revenue and cash flow generation that will provide upside in valuation growth to yield strong investment returns. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">For a more complete description of the Maxpro Board&#146;s reasons for approving the Business Combination, including other factors and risks
considered by the Maxpro Board, see the section entitled &#147;<I>Proposal No.</I><I></I><I>&nbsp;1 &#151; The Business Combination Proposal &#151; The Maxpro Board&#146;s Reasons for the Approval of the Business Combination</I>.&#148; </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><A NAME="toc390280_18"></A>Date, Time and Place of Special Meeting of Maxpro Stockholders </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Special Meeting will be held as a virtual meeting at &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; a.m. Eastern Time, on
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;, 2023 via live webcast at https://www.cstproxy.com/maxprocapitalacquisition/2023 to consider and vote upon the Stockholder
Proposals, or at such other date, time and place to which such meeting may be adjourned. </P>
</div></div>

 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">39 </P>

