subject to Exchange Act reporting obligations that, to some extent, are more lenient and less frequent than those of a U.S. domestic public company. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Apollomics faces various legal and operational risks associated with doing business in Greater China, some of which are outlined here. For a
complete set of risk factors related to doing business in Greater China, please see &#147;<I>Risk Factors &#151; Risks Related to Doing Business in Greater China</I>.&#148; </P>
