<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">if there are maximum redemptions of the outstanding Public Shares (the maximum redemptions that may occur but
which would still provide for the satisfaction of the Minimum Cash Condition), 94.4% of Post-Closing Apollomics Ordinary Shares expected to be outstanding immediately after the Business Combination. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Because of this, Public Stockholders, as a group, will have less influence on the board of directors, management and policies of Post-Closing
Apollomics than they now have on the board of directors, management and policies of Maxpro. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The ownership percentage with respect to
Post-Closing Apollomics following the Business Combination does not take into account the following potential issuances of securities, which will result in further dilution to Public Stockholders who do not redeem their Public Shares: </P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
