Executive Officer, and Yung-Fong (Ron) Song, Maxpro&#146;s Chief Strategy Officer, of an aggregate of 2,946,650 shares of Maxpro Common Stock and 464,150 Private Warrants, consisting of: </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
