$10.44 and the closing price of Maxpro Warrants of $0.0675 on the Nasdaq Global Market on February 17, 2023, the most recent practicable date; </P>  <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
