require brokers trading in Post-Closing Apollomics&#146; ordinary shares to adhere to more stringent rules, possibly resulting in a reduced level of trading activity in the secondary trading market for Post-Closing Apollomics&#146; ordinary shares;
</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
