<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">any major change in Post-Closing Apollomics&#146; Board or management; </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
