including financial statements for the three years ended December&nbsp;31, 2019 through 2021 and projections for the fiscal years ending December&nbsp;31, 2022 through December&nbsp;31, 2040, all as prepared and provided to it by Apollomics&#146;
management; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
