<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">APL-101</FONT> assumed to be priced at a rate comparable to other competitive drugs on the market and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">APL-106</FONT> assumed to be priced in accordance with third party market
research commissioned by Apollomics. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The estimates and assumptions reflected in the prospective financial information
were developed by Apollomics&#146; management based primarily on: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
