but in no event later than the Closing Date: (i)&nbsp;Apollomics&#146; initial listing application with Nasdaq in connection with the Merger to have been approved; (ii)&nbsp;Apollomics to satisfy all applicable initial and continuing listing
requirements of Nasdaq; and (iii)&nbsp;the Post-Closing Apollomics Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares to have been approved for listing on Nasdaq, subject to official notice of issuance; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
