require it to redeem Maxpro Class&nbsp;A Common Stock in an amount that would cause Maxpro not to have, at least $5,000,001 of net tangible assets (as determined in accordance with Rule <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">3a51-1(g)(1)</FONT> of the
Exchange Act); </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
