<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left"><B>1.</B></TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left"><B>Exchange of Apollomics&#146; Shares for Shares of Post-Closing Apollomics </B></P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Based on 1,160,968,844 Apollomics Ordinary Shares outstanding immediately prior to the closing of the Business Combination, the estimated
Exchange Ratio determined in accordance with the terms of the BCA is approximately 0.0733 which indicates that Post-Closing Apollomics expects to issue approximately 85,068,984 Post-Closing Apollomics Ordinary shares to Apollomics&#146; original
shareholders in the Business Combination, determined as follows: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
