 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Unless otherwise indicated, we believe that all persons named in the table below have, or
may be deemed to have, sole voting and investment power with respect to all shares of Maxpro Common Stock beneficially owned, or Post-Closing Apollomics Ordinary Shares to be beneficially owned, by them. </P>
