<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Included in the government grants are amounts in thousands of Australian Dollar (&#147;AUD&#148;) 707
(equivalent to approximately US$497), representing the unconditional subsidies from the Australian government specifically for supporting the research and development activities carried out in Australia for the six months ended June&nbsp;30, 2022,
whilst there is nil for the six months ended June&nbsp;30, 2021. The remaining amounts represent government subsidies in relation to the research and development activities in the US and the PRC. All the government grants provide immediate financial
support with no future related costs nor related to any assets. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
