contractual life of 8.7 years and 7.8 years, respectively. During the six months ended June&nbsp;30, 2021 and 2022, the weighted average fair value of the share options granted is US$0.279 per share and US$0.310 per share, respectively. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The time-based share options will be vested ratably on a monthly basis over range of <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">24-months</FONT> to <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">48-months</FONT> vesting period or with 25% or 50% be vested on the first anniversary of the vesting inception date and remaining portion vested ratably on a monthly basis over range of
<FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">12-months</FONT> to <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">36-months</FONT> vesting period. The milestone-based share options will be vested upon achievement of specified performance conditions. The expected vesting period
is estimated by the management of the Company </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">F-52 </P>

