risk as the year end exposure does not reflect the exposure during the years ended December&nbsp;31, 2020 and 2021. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><U>Interest rate risk
</U></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Group are exposed to fair value interest rate risk in relation to time deposits, lease liabilities and Preferred Shares as
disclosed in Notes 20, 23 and 24, respectively. </P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">F-99 </P>

