ordinary shares of the Company held by Dr.&nbsp;Redkar, carrying interest at 2.07% per annum and repayable on demand. During the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2020, the loan was fully repaid. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The maximum amount outstanding during the years ended December&nbsp;31, 2020 and 2021 were US$133 and nil respectively. </P>
