<TR STYLE="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<TD VALIGN="top">&#147;Notice&#148;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top">written notice unless otherwise specifically stated and as further defined in these Articles.</TD></TR>
<TR STYLE="font-size:1pt">
<TD HEIGHT="8"></TD>
