<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">of the receipt by Apollomics of any notification with respect to the suspension of the qualification of the
Converted Shares included therein for sale in any jurisdiction or the initiation or threatening of any proceeding for such purpose; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
