defense that a remedy at Law would be adequate. In connection with any proceeding for which Apollomics is being granted an award of money damages, the Subscriber agrees that such damages, to the extent payable by such party, shall include, without
limitation, damages related to the consideration that is or was to be paid to Apollomics under this Subscription Agreement, and such damages are not limited to an award of
