</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Rule 501(a), in relevant part, states that an &#147;accredited investor&#148; shall mean any person who comes within any of the below
