securities offered, whose purchase is directed by a sophisticated person as described in &#167; 230.506(b)(2)(ii); </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
