<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Any entity, of a type not listed above, not formed for the specific purpose of acquiring the securities
offered, owning investments in excess of $5,000,000. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:24pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center"><B><I>This page should be completed by Subscriber and constitutes a
