aggregate for each Registration without the prior written approval of the Company) selected by (i)&nbsp;the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">majority-in-interest</FONT></FONT> of the SUO Demanding Holders (as defined
