opportunity to present their separate views on important corporate governance provisions, as three <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">sub-proposals:</FONT> </TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>Proposal No. 2A</I>: A proposal to increase the total number of authorized shares to 650,000,000 shares, consisting of
(i)&nbsp;500,000,000&nbsp;Apollomics Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares of par value US$0.0001, (ii)&nbsp;100,000,000 Apollomics Class&nbsp;B Ordinary Shares of par value US$0.0001, and 50,000,000 Apollomics Preference Shares of par value US$0.0001; </P>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" WIDTH="36%" BORDER="0" STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" ALIGN="center">


