<TD VALIGN="top" ALIGN="center">&#9744; AGAINST</TD>
<TD VALIGN="bottom">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD VALIGN="top" ALIGN="center">&#9744; ABSTAIN</TD></TR>
</TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:5%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>Proposal No. 2B</I>: A proposal to require a special resolution under Cayman Islands law, being the
affirmative vote of the holders of a majority of at least <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">two-thirds</FONT> of the ordinary shares voting in person or by proxy at a general meeting, to make amendments to the Proposed MAA; </P>
<P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
