STYLE="white-space:nowrap">S-K.&nbsp;The</FONT> Registrant hereby agrees to furnish a copy of any omitted schedules to the Commission upon request. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
